OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police arrest man after city
OL,4,Aincident                               
OL,6,FArmed police were sent to Norwich city 
OL,7,Fcentre following reports that a man was
OL,8,Fcarrying a knife and verbally          
OL,9,Fthreatening people.                    
OL,11,FThe officers arrived in the Gentleman's
OL,12,FWalk area after Norfolk Police was     
OL,13,Fcontacted just before 12:30 GMT on     
OL,14,FSunday.                                
OL,16,FThe force said it safely detained the  
OL,17,Fman in a shop on nearby Exchange       
OL,18,FStreet. He was arrested and taken to   
OL,19,FWymondham Police Investigation Centre  
OL,20,Ffor questioning.                       
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
