OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police arrest man after city
OL,4,Aincident                               
OL,6,FNo injuries have been reported, and an 
OL,7,Finvestigation into the incident is     
OL,8,Fongoing. The BBC has asked Norfolk     
OL,9,FPolice what the man was arrested on    
OL,10,Fsuspicion of.                          
